{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54360","headline":"初出长安 · 杜荀鹤","name":"初出长安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一乍出皇都，时登日月余。\n遥看山（何）近远，店舍路崎岖。\n想料天子女，翻华（疑）草外夫。\n然虽朋流下，荣辱□□□。\n（〖1〗以上三首均见伯四九八五卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}